{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Streets of Rageness is a reimagined '90s beat 'em up classic set in a crime-ridden city under the iron grip of a ruthless syndicate. Amid rampant looting, chaos, and destruction, fight through waves of thugs to become the most powerful fighter on the streets!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210270/extras/9b6b64c4a82122fac9776583eae96e1a.webp?t=1772360306\" width=616 height=49 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210270/extras/d8f2cd9ba2180794ac34fc8506fa560f.poster.avif?t=1772360306\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210270/extras/d8f2cd9ba2180794ac34fc8506fa560f.webm?t=1772360306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210270/extras/d8f2cd9ba2180794ac34fc8506fa560f.mp4?t=1772360306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Streets of Rageness</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streets of Rageness takes the classic beat 'em up formula to a whole new level with immersive 3D environments and dynamic combat inspired by iconic fighting games like Street Fighter and Tekken. Step into the shoes of a diverse cast of street fighters, each with unique abilities and fighting styles, as you battle through a series of gritty, urban arenas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210270/extras/85d9cc6336c2d6b009edf41b88672ccc.webp?t=1772360306\" width=616 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210270/extras/a970c8e2aa7ec3c980d443567714418e.poster.avif?t=1772360306\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210270/extras/a970c8e2aa7ec3c980d443567714418e.webm?t=1772360306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210270/extras/a970c8e2aa7ec3c980d443567714418e.mp4?t=1772360306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master powerful punch and kick combos, unleash devastating special moves, and engage in fast-paced brawls against waves of ruthless enemies. The game offers a visceral, adrenaline-pumping experience that captures old-school arcade action with a fresh twist. Explore detailed cityscapes, conquer challenging bosses, and prove yourself as the ultimate street warrior in this homage to the classic Streets of Rage series.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome to Streets of Rageness","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3210270/cb6a7ff241580c71a133fb0db789e130ce4c1391.jpg"},{"name":"Rookie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3210270/2b5f79d5b8b7f51e21477c345b4e25b94751acad.jpg"},{"name":"Amateur","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3210270/4ec3ba1d558ed0375912d207ba7b1bc6035c1ad0.jpg"},{"name":"Pro","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3210270/d9375b919632b8ee64dda032c6b8665c0712a2d0.jpg"},{"name":"Legend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3210270/f720d8c4bb221fb849854e6d99d5b9fe592a3b42.jpg"},{"name":"Combo Breaker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3210270/dc00b0ef54b976d6e0da56a13ab03f95c9615a60.jpg"},{"name":"Dodge Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3210270/428bc5548c1d0dc5be6a4b02e92481656c309162.jpg"}],"total":7},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3210270?t=1772360306","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3210270?t=1772360306","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210270/3e7aebf0033442e3c33f8449154e6a3c8bb2e730/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772360306","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210270/3e7aebf0033442e3c33f8449154e6a3c8bb2e730/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772360306","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Features violence in terms of combat action, but there is no blood or bad language involved."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Join the fight club!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210270/extras/66c5fc1fdf73cddeb6a5ed46de6dcc4c.avif?t=1772360306\" width=600 height=190 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Streets of Rageness is a reimagined '90s beat 'em up classic set in a crime-ridden city under the iron grip of a ruthless syndicate. Amid rampant looting, chaos, and destruction, fight through waves of thugs to become the most powerful fighter on the streets!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210270/extras/9b6b64c4a82122fac9776583eae96e1a.webp?t=1772360306\" width=616 height=49 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210270/extras/d8f2cd9ba2180794ac34fc8506fa560f.poster.avif?t=1772360306\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210270/extras/d8f2cd9ba2180794ac34fc8506fa560f.webm?t=1772360306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210270/extras/d8f2cd9ba2180794ac34fc8506fa560f.mp4?t=1772360306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Streets of Rageness</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streets of Rageness takes the classic beat 'em up formula to a whole new level with immersive 3D environments and dynamic combat inspired by iconic fighting games like Street Fighter and Tekken. Step into the shoes of a diverse cast of street fighters, each with unique abilities and fighting styles, as you battle through a series of gritty, urban arenas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210270/extras/85d9cc6336c2d6b009edf41b88672ccc.webp?t=1772360306\" width=616 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210270/extras/a970c8e2aa7ec3c980d443567714418e.poster.avif?t=1772360306\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210270/extras/a970c8e2aa7ec3c980d443567714418e.webm?t=1772360306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210270/extras/a970c8e2aa7ec3c980d443567714418e.mp4?t=1772360306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master powerful punch and kick combos, unleash devastating special moves, and engage in fast-paced brawls against waves of ruthless enemies. The game offers a visceral, adrenaline-pumping experience that captures old-school arcade action with a fresh twist. Explore detailed cityscapes, conquer challenging bosses, and prove yourself as the ultimate street warrior in this homage to the classic Streets of Rage series.</p>","developers":["Hard Shark Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210270/header.jpg?t=1772360306","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Hard Shark Games. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3210270/750109/04c3d3557518c2ee2b9c90fc4220c78e2d59e5c8/1750881288/dash_av1.mpd?t=1731770088","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3210270/750109/04c3d3557518c2ee2b9c90fc4220c78e2d59e5c8/1750881288/dash_h264.mpd?t=1731770088","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3210270/750109/04c3d3557518c2ee2b9c90fc4220c78e2d59e5c8/1750881288/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1731770088","id":257051861,"name":"Official Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257051861/062456e772e7d7f8233ec5847c1897acbaea8e9c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=173177